stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Submitted : Request a Change form
    Submitted --> UnderAssessment : engineer writes impact assessment
    UnderAssessment --> Rejected : change control board rejects
    UnderAssessment --> Approved : change control board approves
    Approved --> Implemented : requirement edited in Baserow, sync Pull Request merged
    Implemented --> Closed : RTM recomputed, verification re-run
    Rejected --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]

    state Approved {
        [*] --> EditRequirement
        EditRequirement --> NewID : requirement removed or replaced
        NewID --> OldSetObsolete : old ID set to Obsolete, never reused
        EditRequirement --> SameID : wording changed
        SameID --> BackToApproved : status Baselined to Approved
    }
